      "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2020 the syndicate's gross claims outstanding was $609.34m. Analysis of development shows a very small net favourable prior-year movement (approximately $0.2m release) across older underwriting years. The report notes a $10.7m profit on development of the 2017 and prior years driven by reinsurance to close arrangements and favourable development, while the 2018 pure year incurred losses driven by 2018 catastrophe events. Current year catastrophe activity (Hurricane Laura, Sally, Midwest Derecho and US wildfires) and COVID-19 produced material current-year claims, but prior-year reserve movements were modest. The prior-year movement was derived from the claims development triangle and may be influenced by a split RITC transaction undertaken during closure of the 2018 year.",
